      #|  invariant:S->bool
      #|  ! (<<) p q c invariant.\n        WF(<<) /\\\n        (e AND invariant) IMPLIES p /\\\n        ((NOT e) AND invariant) IMPLIES q /\\\n        (!X:S. correct\n               (p AND (\\s. X = s)) c (invariant AND (\\s. s << X)))\n        ==> correct p (DO c e) q
      #|  !p g q. p IMPLIES (g AND q) ==> correct p (ASSERT g) q
      #|  p IMPLIES (q o f) ==> correct p (Assign f) q
      #|  p IMPLIES q ==> correct p SKIP q
      #|  F ==> correct p ABORT q
      #|  p IMPLIES (b AND q) ==> correct p (ASSERT b) q
      #|  correct (p AND e) c1 q /\\ correct (p AND NOT e) c2 q\n   ==> correct p (Ite e c1 c2) q
      #|  correct (p AND e) c q /\\ p AND NOT e IMPLIES q\n   ==> correct p (IF e c) q
      #|  WF(<<) /\\\n   p IMPLIES invariant /\\\n   (NOT e) AND invariant IMPLIES q /\\\n   (!X. correct\n        (invariant AND e AND (\\s. X = s)) c (invariant AND (\\s. s << X)))\n   ==> correct p (AWHILE invariant (<<) e c) q
      #|  (m:S->num) X
      #|  X:S
