      #|  WF(<<) /\\\n   (e AND invariant) IMPLIES p /\\\n   ((NOT e) AND invariant) IMPLIES q /\\\n   (!X. correct\n          (p AND (\\s. X = s)) c (invariant AND (\\s. s << X)))\n   ==> correct p (ADO invariant (<<) c e) q
      #|  (m:S->num) X
